# pq-devnet-4 bootnodes (QUIC multiaddrs)
#
# Operational run target while pq-devnet-5 has no public always-on mesh.
# One multiaddr per line. Lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# Paste operator / lean-quickstart nodes.yaml ENR-derived QUIC multiaddrs
# for the active pq-devnet-4 interop run, for example:
# /ip4/203.0.113.10/udp/9000/quic-v1/p2p/12D3KooWExamplePeerIdReplaceMe
#
# Also accepted via:
#   ethean start --network pq-devnet-4 --bootnodes '<addr1>,<addr2>'
#   ETHEAN_BOOTNODES='<addr1>,<addr2>'
